6	Discrete Maths Course Outline	notes	documents/2026/09/Discrete20Maths20Course20Outline_WNHiscz.pdf	126827	13	DISCRETE MATHEMATICS\nMTH 1101\n\nLecturer: Gershom Buri (bgershom@must.ac.ug)\n\nTeaching Assitants (TA):\n1. Adelin Habimana (2024bse064@std.must.ac.ug)\n2. Tracy Natukunda (2024bse148@std.must.ac.ug)\n3. Ark Akandinda (2023BSE011@std.must.ac.ug)\n\n8/12/2025\n\nCourse description\n\n• This course introduces fundamental concepts in Discrete Mathematics, emphasizing their application in computer science and software Engineering.\n\n• It provides the student with knowledge of developing a logical mode of thought that will be applicable to computer design; both hard ware and software.\n\n8/12/2025\n\nWhy study Mathematics?\n\n• Computation is something that we can’t see or touch but consistently obeys strict rules\n\n• We need a universal language that allows us to reason about things we can’t see or touch, but that follows simple strict rules . . . .\n\n• Voilà enters Mathematics !!! 🤗\n\n• Bonus: Recent most profitable inventions in computing are deep-rooted in mathematics e.g. Bitcoin, Facebook, google search, AI.\n\n• Important for Leet code!\n\n8/12/2025\n\nCourse Objectives\n\n• Develop logical thinking and reasoning\n\n8/12/2025\n\n[Page 5: could not be read — 429 You exceeded your current quota, please check your plan and billing details. For more information on this error, head to: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/rate-limits. To monitor your current usage, head to: https://ai.dev/rate-limit. \n* Quota exceeded for metric: generativelanguage.googleapis.com/generate_content_free_tier_requests, limit: 5, model: gemini-3.6-flash\nPlease retry in 6.903701033s. [links {\n  description: "Learn more about Gemini API quotas"\n  url: "https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/rate-limits"\n}\n, violations {\n  quota_metric: "generativelanguage.googleapis.com/generate_content_free_tier_requests"\n  quota_id: "GenerateRequestsPerMinutePerProjectPerModel-FreeT